{"sha": "8faf0fd7029ae5d16e9fcf2fbe7a4ce89d231b407255392ff06fecb4ae084d8a", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=6cm,", "    xmin=-2.6, xmax=2.6, ymin=-3.6, ymax=3.9,", "    xtick={-2,-1,1,2}, ytick={-3,-2,-1,1,2,3}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=-2.05:2.05, samples=120]", "    {cosh(x)} node[pos=0.1, right, font=\\small] {$\\cosh$};", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=-2.05:2.05, samples=120]", "    {sinh(x)} node[pos=0.93, above left, font=\\small] {$\\sinh$};", "  \\addplot[dashed, gray, domain=0:2.5] {exp(x)/2};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{scope}[xshift=7.4cm]", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=6.4cm, height=6cm,", "    xmin=-3.2, xmax=3.2, ymin=-1.5, ymax=1.5,", "    xtick={-2,-1,1,2}, ytick={-1,1}]", "  \\addplot[omMeth, very thick, domain=-3:3, samples=150]", "    {tanh(x)} node[pos=0.9, above left, font=\\small] {$\\tanh$};", "  \\addplot[dashed, gray, domain=-3:3] {1};", "  \\addplot[dashed, gray, domain=-3:3] {-1};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：$\\cosh$ 与 $\\sinh$，渐近地贴合于", "$\\frac{\\eu^x}{2}$（虚线）。右图：$\\tanh$，自 $-1$ 递增至", "$1$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[为什么叫“双曲”？]", "点 $(\\cosh t, \\sinh t)$ 沿 $x > 0$ 的那支双曲线", "$x^2 - y^2 = 1$ 运行（由", "\\cref{prop:b1:functions:hyprules}~(1)），正如 $(\\cos t, \\sin", "t)$ 沿圆 $x^2 + y^2 = 1$ 运行。每个圆函数恒等式", "都有对应的双曲形式，符号的变化由", "$\\sinh^2 \\leftrightarrow -\\sin^2$ 决定。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{example}[$\\tanh$ 的加法公式]\\label{ex:b1:functions:tanhadd}", "将", "\\cref{prop:b1:functions:hyprules}~(3)中的两个加法公式都除以 $\\cosh x\\cosh y$：", "\\[", "\\tanh(x + y)", "= \\frac{\\sinh x\\cosh y + \\cosh x\\sinh y}", "{\\cosh x\\cosh y + \\sinh x\\sinh y}", "= \\frac{\\tanh x + \\tanh y}{1 + \\tanh x\\,\\tanh y} ,", "\\]", "即正切加法公式的双曲类似式 --- 其中", "$+$ 对应三角情形中的 $-$。附带的收获是：由 $\\abs{\\tanh}", "< 1$，右端是一条“速度叠加”法则，", "它永不越出 $\\intoo{-1}1$：若 $u, v \\in \\intoo{-1}1$，则", "$\\frac{u + v}{1 + uv} \\in \\intoo{-1}1$ 亦然（记 $u = \\tanh", "a$，$v = \\tanh b$，由双射性可作此设，并将公式", "倒过来用）。直接用代数方法验证，不借助双曲函数，", "是一道略显繁琐的练习；若以", "$\\tanh$ 作参数化，则只需一行 --- 这与圆函数", "为单位圆提供的策略如出一辙。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[反双曲函数]\\label{prop:b1:functions:invhyp}", "由\\cref{prop:b1:functions:hyprules}~(4)所保证的反函数", "均有如下显式表达式：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{arsinh} x = \\ln\\bigl(x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 1}\\bigr)", "\\ (x \\in \\R),", "\\qquad", "\\operatorname{arcosh} x = \\ln\\bigl(x + \\sqrt{x^2 - 1}\\bigr)", "\\ (x \\geq 1),", "\\]", "\\[", "\\operatorname{artanh} x = \\frac 12 \\ln\\frac{1 + x}{1 - x}", "\\ (\\abs x < 1),", "\\]", "其导数依次为 $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$、$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}$", "（$x > 1$）与 $\\frac{1}{1 - x^2}$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "对 $\\operatorname{arsinh}$：解方程 $x = \\sinh y = \\frac{\\eu^y -", "\\eu^{-y}}{2}$。令 $u = \\eu^y > 0$，得 $u^2 - 2xu - 1 = 0$，故 $u = x", "+ \\sqrt{x^2 + 1}$（另一根 $x - \\sqrt{x^2+1}$ 为负），且 $y =", "\\ln(x + \\sqrt{x^2+1})$。另外两式的计算完全类似", "（$u^2 - 2xu + 1 = 0$，对应 $\\operatorname{arcosh}$，取", "$\\geq 1$ 的根）；对 $\\operatorname{artanh}$ 只需化简两行即可。", "求导：对对数式直接求导，例如", "\\[", "\\bigl(\\ln(x + \\sqrt{x^2+1})\\bigr)'", "= \\frac{1 + \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}}{x + \\sqrt{x^2+1}}", "= \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2 + 1}} . \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[显式公式的应用]\\label{ex:b1:functions:arcoshtwo}", "由显式公式，方程 $\\cosh t = 2$ 在 $t \\geq 0$ 时的解为", "$t = \\operatorname{arcosh} 2 = \\ln(2 + \\sqrt3) \\approx", "1.317$；由偶性，另一解为 $-t$。事实上", "$\\ln(2 - \\sqrt3) = \\ln\\frac1{2 + \\sqrt3} = -\\ln(2 + \\sqrt3)$：", "$u = \\eu^t$ 满足二次方程 $u^2 - 4u + 1 = 0$，其两根", "互为倒数（其积为 $1$，正是韦达定理所要求的）。这个小例子", "体现了一般的规律：双曲方程", "可化为关于 $\\eu^t$ 的二次方程，而 $t \\mapsto -t$ 的对称性", "在二次方程中表现为 $u \\mapsto 1/u$ 的对称性 ---", "解 \\cref{exo:b1:functions:7} 时值得牢记。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[选取恰当的原函数形式]\\label{met:b1:functions:primitive}", "求积分时需熟记的三个基本形式", "（在\\cref{ch:b1:integration}中）：", "\\[", "\\int \\frac{\\dd x}{1 + x^2} = \\arctan x + C,", "\\qquad", "\\int \\frac{\\dd x}{\\sqrt{1 - x^2}} = \\arcsin x + C,", "\\qquad", "\\int \\frac{\\dd x}{\\sqrt{x^2 + 1}} = \\operatorname{arsinh} x + C,", "\\]", "对一般的二次式，先配方，", "再作伸缩，化归为上述形式。", "\\end{method}", ""]}